  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://jssc.jharkhand.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Jharkhand Staff Selection Commission (JSSC)</a> </span>has released the notification for the Post Of Para Teacher JTAACCE. This recruitment has been issued for 7299 posts. Online applying process for JSSC Para Teacher JTAACCE Recruitment 2026 will start from 31 July 2026 &amp; the candidates can apply till 30 August 2026. Candidates must check the complete details for JSSC Para Teacher JTAACCE Recruitment 2026 which has given below.&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Jharkhand Staff Selection Commission (JSSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">JSSC Para Teacher JTAACCE Recruitment 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">JSSC Para Teacher JTAACCE Advt No. : 04-05/2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>31 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>30 August 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>01 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Photo/ Sign Upload Last Date : <strong>03 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Date:<strong> 05-07 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>Notify Later</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EBC, BC, EWS <strong>: Rs. 100/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST <strong>: Rs. 50/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>JSSC Para Teacher JTAACCE Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 01 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"bh4194\" data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"127\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age: <strong>21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"732pd1\" data-start=\"128\" data-end=\"160\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>35 Years (General/EWS)</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1862mos\" data-start=\"195\" data-end=\"245\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age: <strong>37 Years (EBC-I &amp; BC-II – Male)</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1o001bb\" data-start=\"246\" data-end=\"302\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>38 Years (Women – UR/EWS/EBC-I/BC-II)</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1gn7xpi\" data-start=\"303\" data-end=\"351\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age: <strong>40 Years (SC/ST – Male &amp; Female)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per Jharkhand JSSC Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Use  Tool – </span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>JSSC Para Teacher JTAACCE Online Form 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 7299 Posts</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>JSSC Para Teacher JTAACCE Recruitment&nbsp; 2026 : Category Wise Vacancy Details</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 55.4054%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 44.5946%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 55.4054%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Intermediate Trained Assistant&nbsp;Teacher</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 44.5946%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">2756</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 55.4054%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Graduate Trained Assistant Teacher (Language Knowledge)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 44.5946%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">1887</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 55.4054%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Graduate Trained Assistant Teacher (Social Science)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 44.5946%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">908</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 55.4054%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Graduate Trained Assistant Teacher (Science and Mathematics)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 44.5946%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">1748</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>JSSC Para Teacher JTAACCE Recruitment 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Qualification</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Intermediate Trained Assistant&nbsp;Teacher</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have <strong>passed 10+2 (Intermediate)</strong> with at least <strong>50% marks</strong> (45% as per NCTE norms) along with a <strong>2-year Diploma in Elementary Education (D.El.Ed.)</strong> or equivalent, or a 4-year <strong>B.El.Ed.,</strong> or a <strong>2-year Diploma in Special Education,</strong> or a <strong>Graduation degree with a 2-year D.El.Ed.</strong> Candidates must also have<strong> qualified JTET/CTET</strong> or an equivalent Teacher Eligibility Test as prescribed in the notification.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Graduate Trained Assistant Teacher (Language Knowledge)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\" rowspan=\"3\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have a <strong>Bachelor’s degree with D.El.Ed., B.Ed., B.Ed. (Special Education), B.El.Ed., B.A.B.Ed./B.Sc.B.Ed.,</strong> or an equivalent teacher education qualification as prescribed by NCTE. Candidates <strong>must also have qualified JTET/CTET</strong> or an equivalent Teacher Eligibility Test as specified in the notification.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Graduate Trained Assistant Teacher (Social Science)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Graduate Trained Assistant Teacher (Science and Mathematics)</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>JSSC Para Teacher JTAACCE Online Form 2026 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://jssc.jharkhand.gov.in/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the JSSC before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sarkari Result 2026</a> Notification Here – <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Check Now.</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for JSSC Para Teacher JTAACCE recruitment can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Note – छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले Official Notification (Last Date, Age Limit, Qualification) को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे।</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>JSSC Para Teacher JTAACCE Recruitment 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Exam&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">PET/PST</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Verification</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariResult on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADML